# paper-data is ~19 GB of dated authoring-run dirs that no cell reads (the plots
# cell consumes /results via --results-root + --tag-map). Exclude them by
# directory-name prefix so the whole subtree is dropped (the legacy builder does
# not recurse a trailing-slash glob, and a `!` negation forces a full walk).
# Kept: paper-data/scripts/, paper-data/diagrams.yaml, paper-data/*.md.
paper-data/2026-*
paper-data/q10-*
